OL,3,GNEWSANew owner for Acorn carbon capture
OL,4,Aand storage project
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Acorn carbon capture and storage
OL,7,Fproject in Aberdeenshire has a new
OL,8,Fowner after the main developer put its
OL,9,Fstake up for sale.
OL,11,FThe project will take carbon dioxide
OL,12,Femissions from industrial processes in
OL,13,FScotland and store them in depleted gas
OL,14,Freservoirs under the North Sea via the
OL,15,Fterminal at St Fergus.
OL,17,FConcerns had been raised about the
OL,18,Fviability of the Acorn Project after
OL,19,Fmajor stakeholder Storegga said it
OL,20,Fplanned to sell its share.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
